#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Hardware Abstraction Layer (HAL)
#  File: hardware_abstraction_layer.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS HAL responsible for:
#      • device registration
#      • driver binding
#      • hardware capability mapping
#      • IO request dispatch
#      • hardware event routing
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Device Registration](ca://s?q=Explain_HAL_Device_Registration)
#    - [Driver Binding](ca://s?q=Explain_HAL_Driver_Binding)
#    - [Hardware Capabilities](ca://s?q=Explain_HAL_Capabilities)
#    - [IO Dispatch](ca://s?q=Explain_HAL_IO_Dispatch)
#    - [HAL Snapshot](ca://s?q=Explain_HAL_Snapshot)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_device(name, type, capabilities)
#         Registers a hardware device.
#
#    - register_driver(name, device_type, handler)
#         Registers a driver for a device type.
#
#    - bind(device_id, driver_name)
#         Binds driver to device.
#
#    - register_io(device_type, handler)
#         Registers IO handler for device type.
#
#    - io(device_id, payload)
#         Executes IO request.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns HAL state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  DEVICE STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "DEV-XXXX",
#      "name": "keyboard0",
#      "type": "input",
#      "capabilities": { "keys": 104 },
#      "driver": "kbd.driver"
#    }
#
